      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Appointment Reminders for a Neighbourhood Clinic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fictional clinic automated appointment reminders while keeping a staff review step."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "4adf77da-6519-429c-8839-cce22ab4d26a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Context and Challenge"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Reminders were sent by hand, and staff reviewed the list each morning."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "4adf77da-6519-429c-8839-cce22ab4d26a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Solution"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Reminders go out by text message and email; patients reply to confirm or cancel."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "4adf77da-6519-429c-8839-cce22ab4d26a"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "bd70b693-17b2-4834-8d16-fa016428a244"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cancelled slots return to the booking calendar for reuse."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "bd70b693-17b2-4834-8d16-fa016428a244"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The workflow keeps a human in the loop while removing manual messaging."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "4adf77da-6519-429c-8839-cce22ab4d26a"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "bd70b693-17b2-4834-8d16-fa016428a244"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
